XdgSurfaceStableTest.creating_xdg_surface_from_wl_surface_with_committed_buffer_is_an_error

# A truncated shm file: a test WLCS itself gets wrong up to 1.8.1 (Mir
# skips it for those versions).
BadBufferTest.test_truncated_shm_file

# The selection is set with serial 0 ("works while Mir fails to validate
# the serial", says the test); wlroots refuses a serial the client never
# had, so clients can't take the clipboard without input.
